ind":"announcement","title":"Expendabots Demo Is Live! Next Stop: Steam Next Fest","summary":"Expendabots demo is out now, and we’re bringing it to Steam Next Fest! We’ve been busy fixing issues, adding a tutorial, and finding new ways for you to mess with your friends. And if you’re a streamer, your viewers can now join in on the fun. Your definition of “fun” may differ from theirs. Watch our new Expendabots Steam Next Fest Demo trailer🎓 Tutorial: Your first day on the jobNew to Expendabots? We’ve added a tutorial to help you learn the ropes before heading into the ever-changing islands","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T15:08:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681863","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809820-1842212951310876","game_id":"steam-3809820","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Update: Dungeon Quotas & Emotes!","summary":"Hello, expendable friends! 🤖Our latest patch, straight outta Gamescom, is here, with changes shaped by your public playtest feedback. We’ve simplified the expedition loop, made it easier to keep your 3D printer fed, and finally taught your robots some moves 🦾During Gamescom, Apollolol dropped by to say hi and pick up her 3D-printed gift! 🐤Every dungeon has its own quotaThe biggest change in this update! 🔝We’ve simplified the core gameplay loop: zipline down from the airship, choose a dungeon, an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T17:01:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310876","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809820-1840944183787085","game_id":"steam-3809820","kind":"update","title":"The Heartbeat update is out now 🫀","summary":"The Heartbeat Update is here!Over the past month, we have been actively playtesting Expendabots and collecting your feedback on our Discord and directly in the game. Your reports, ideas, and reactions helped shape this update. Thanks to your input, we are excited to bring it to you today.IMPROVED UI We have overhauled almost the entire user interface and added many new indicators. Important information should now be clearer, easier to read, and quicker to understand during a expedition.You can n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T19:28:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809820-1838407329257721","game_id":"steam-3809820","kind":"announcement","title":"Expendabots Public Playtest is now live!","summary":"Expendabots - Public Playtest is now live!Grab up to three friends and experience our robotic 1–4 player co-op extraction game Expendabots. Explore dangerous locations, collect valuable resources and try to bring your highly disposable robots back in one piece.What can you expect?1–4 player online co-op (public or friends-only lobby)Every run is unique thanks to procedurally generated islands and dungeonsInterchangeable robotic hands with different abilitiesProximity voice chat3D printing as cra","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T19:45:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329257721","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809820-1834602721198354","game_id":"steam-3809820","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch Devs Play","summary":"Expendabots is a 4-player cooperative horror extraction game where players control clunky but resourceful Expendabots scavenging procedurally generated islands.Expendabots was revealed on Future Games Show Summer Showcase.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-08T10:09:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721198354","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809820-1834602721195887","game_id":"steam-3809820","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Expendabots - Craft on the Fly, Extract, Repeat - No Refunds!","summary":"Hey everyone! 🤖 We’re excited to finally announce Expendabots, our frantic new 4-player co-op horror extraction game - revealed today during the Future Games Show. Watch the Announcement TrailerThis has been a long time coming, and seeing Expendabots out in the world feels surreal. Our team at Collision Games, alongside our publishing friends at Blue Brain Games have been working behind the scenes for months on this reveal. In Expendabots, you and your squad will drop into ever-shifting islands ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T13:23:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721195887","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3809820-1834602721194815","game_id":"steam-3809820","kind":"announcement","title":"Announcing Expendabots - Craft on the Fly, Extract, Repeat - No Refunds!","summary":"Hey everyone! 🤖 We’re excited to finally announce Expendabots, our frantic new 4-player co-op horror extraction game - revealed today during the Future Games Show. Watch the Announcement TrailerThis has been a long time coming, and seeing Expendabots out in the world feels surreal. Our team at Collision Games, alongside our publishing friends at Blue Brain Games have been working behind the scenes for months on this reveal. In Expendabots, you and your squad will drop into ever-shifting islands ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T21:08:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194815","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3809820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3809820":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3809820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z"},"5269730":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:22Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3809820","app_id":3809820,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"d7d95bcb1c1ea0a9e677912fe93539b2cb57a6e9467278740a1256d09b6652e2","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Expendabots is a 1–4 player co-op horror-extraction game where expendable robots explore ever-changing islands and terrifying dungeons. Outmatched and vulnerable, you’ll need to stay quiet, hide from hostile creatures, survive the horrors, and extract with your squad before the island is lost.","publishers":[{"name":"Blue Brain Games","creator_clan_account_id":37015325}],"developers":[{"name":"Collision Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,